%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11_Chapter11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_11
  storyName: The Easiest Way Out
  storyDescription: 'The Council explains Concept Erasure. Battle: Regu, the Special
    Concept of Regulation.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 11
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2303977e22bd8bb7b781ef76466a4df, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 287f38355bf78882790dcdb8d428d346, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your performance has been satisfactory so far, Fajar.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Thanks, I guess.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: There is something important we need to explain before your next assignment.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What's that?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your authority as King grants you access to an ability known as Concept
        Erasure.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Concept... Erasure?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. It allows you to erase a concept from existence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That sounds pretty straightforward.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is precisely why it is dangerous.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Concept Erasure is one of the easiest abilities for a King to activate.
        However, controlling its consequences is an entirely different matter.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What happens if I erase something?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That depends on what you erase. Concepts are connected to one another
        through countless dependencies. Removing one may affect many others.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Imagine removing a single component from a system without knowing what
        depends on it. The consequences may extend far beyond your original intention.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So I could accidentally break something much bigger?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Exactly.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then why give me that ability in the first place?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Because it is necessary for the King to maintain balance. Some situations
        cannot be resolved through ordinary Concept Clashes.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: But you must not use it carelessly. Especially while your understanding
        of Concept World is still limited.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Got it. Don't delete things just because I can.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is a good way to put it.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A short pause.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Now, we have another assignment for you.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...I knew it.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We want you to weaken the Special Concept of Regulation.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regulation? Is that another recurring assignment?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not exactly. This is a special investigation.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What's special about it?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We want to measure how deeply your mind can process conceptual abstraction.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your ability to perceive Ei-Pi on your first day was unusual. We want
        to know whether you can handle more complex concepts.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And Regulation is the test?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. Regu is currently one of the closest concepts we have found to the
        idea of authoritarianism.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Why not just find the Concept Spirit of Dictatorship?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We have not been able to locate one.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regulation is not the same as Dictatorship. However, when Regulation
        becomes excessively dominant, it can be used to justify oppressive systems.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regu is also periodically weakened to prevent her relevance from becoming
        dangerous.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So, just like Vio?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Similar in principle.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Alright. I'll take the assignment.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: GREEN LAB
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar and Noz arrive in an area filled with abstract panels, documents,
        and rigid geometric structures.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: This is where Regu is most likely to be found.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Looks like an office.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: An understandable interpretation.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please tell me she isn't going to make me fill out paperwork.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I cannot guarantee that.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A voice comes from behind a stack of documents.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Excuse me. Do you have an appointment?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regu steps forward, holding a folder.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Are you Regu?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That depends. Who is asking?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: This is Fajar, the newly appointed King of All Concepts.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh! The new King. I see.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: "I'm here to\u2014"
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please wait. Before proceeding, I need to verify whether this interaction
        complies with the current regulations.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Seriously?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Naturally. Rules exist for a reason.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'm here to weaken your relevance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Ah. I see. Then I suppose we can skip the paperwork.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's convenient.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not really. I was looking forward to making you fill it out.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regu smiles.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, Your Majesty. Let's see whether you can enforce your authority
        against mine.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 1
    lines: []
    level: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c81c6de30ae22ef60ac2eaf74951f5fb, type: 2}
    team:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Regu lowers her folder.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, that was rather inconvenient.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Sorry about that.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: No need to apologize. I suppose I'll have to revise a few things.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The assignment is complete. Regu's relevance has been reduced.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fcc612448021e71491ea8237a9351f8, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Until next time, Your Majesty. Please remember to follow the proper procedures.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah, sure.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar and Noz leave.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: WHITE FIELD
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: -2227176189160616940, guid: 0b0ce7031ad60871fa6b57113d8933da,
        type: 3}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That should be the last assignment for today, right?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: According to the current instructions, yes.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Great. Let's head back.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: As they walk, Fajar notices a familiar figure standing nearby.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hey. You!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The white figure turns around. This time, she doesn't immediately run.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're the one I saw earlier, aren't you?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Who is she?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I believe I recognize her.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Hello?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're a Concept Spirit?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6d914e1b91a42b51a008c5b6d584b65, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. I think so.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
